{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Station Project Demo</strong> is a game that lets you step into the role of a train station manager. Start with simple tasks like renovation and ticket sales. In the full version, you will also be able to hire a team of assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Renovation</strong> - Clean up a run-down station building, get rid of accumulated junk, replace floors, paint walls and repair damaged equipment. A well-maintained building will attract more customers and generate more profit from the services you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Renovation.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve customers</strong> - Start by selling tickets to increase the range of services offered over time. Open a point for sending and receiving mail packages and a lost and found office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Serve_customers.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Additional Businesses</strong> - Your station is not just about ticket sales! The usable area of the building increases with each upgrade. In full version you can open your own shop, set up vending machines, and even create an arcade room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Create_Additional_Businesses.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Employees.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> - Remember that your resources are not infinite. You need to take care of your warehouse and regularly plan to order products for the store, vending machines and even things for your office. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trains!</strong> - In addition to observing passing passenger trains, you can earn extra cash by performing cleaning service tasks on train cars. You can skip these assignments, but over time, your permissions will increase to more responsible roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Trains.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo gives you access to the core management and renovation features of Train Station Project, letting you experience the beginning of your station's transformation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Station building upgrades: Accessible up to Tier 3 of 6<br></li><li>Bathroom upgrades: Accessible up to Tier 3 of 6<br></li><li>Warehouse upgrades: Accessible up to Tier 1 of 4<br></li><li>Mini-market, staff house, arcade room, photo booths, and coin laundry: <strong>Locked in the demo</strong><br></li><li>All main construction and customization objects are available to try<br></li><li>Events and additional gameplay systems are limited</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:</strong> Employee housing, advanced shops, entertainment rooms, and several late-game features are only available in the full version. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3112070?t=1755260989","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/210db07b2c2041b255452f17f21f65ffb8f92b76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755260989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/0a031a8a71de5d7e343182c6f8c7809b0beba0f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755260989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/0a031a8a71de5d7e343182c6f8c7809b0beba0f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755260989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Station Project Demo</strong> is a game that lets you step into the role of a train station manager. Start with simple tasks like renovation and ticket sales. In the full version, you will also be able to hire a team of assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Renovation</strong> - Clean up a run-down station building, get rid of accumulated junk, replace floors, paint walls and repair damaged equipment. A well-maintained building will attract more customers and generate more profit from the services you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Renovation.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve customers</strong> - Start by selling tickets to increase the range of services offered over time. Open a point for sending and receiving mail packages and a lost and found office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Serve_customers.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Additional Businesses</strong> - Your station is not just about ticket sales! The usable area of the building increases with each upgrade. In full version you can open your own shop, set up vending machines, and even create an arcade room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Create_Additional_Businesses.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Employees.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> - Remember that your resources are not infinite. You need to take care of your warehouse and regularly plan to order products for the store, vending machines and even things for your office. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trains!</strong> - In addition to observing passing passenger trains, you can earn extra cash by performing cleaning service tasks on train cars. You can skip these assignments, but over time, your permissions will increase to more responsible roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/extras/Trains.gif?t=1755260989\" /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo gives you access to the core management and renovation features of Train Station Project, letting you experience the beginning of your station's transformation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Station building upgrades: Accessible up to Tier 3 of 6<br></li><li>Bathroom upgrades: Accessible up to Tier 3 of 6<br></li><li>Warehouse upgrades: Accessible up to Tier 1 of 4<br></li><li>Mini-market, staff house, arcade room, photo booths, and coin laundry: <strong>Locked in the demo</strong><br></li><li>All main construction and customization objects are available to try<br></li><li>Events and additional gameplay systems are limited</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:</strong> Employee housing, advanced shops, entertainment rooms, and several late-game features are only available in the full version. </p>","developers":["TSP Team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2681560","name":"Train Station Project"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112070/27a8502a0ba9cc5d9ac9d66b43f0dcc8273ed2c7/header.jpg?t=1755260989","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135210,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135210/movie480.mp4?t=1754661752","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135210/movie_max.mp4?t=1754661752"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135210/1d9d9148b165a4b610307cbd3723c0dde4b03a35/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754661752","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135210/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754661752","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135210/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754661752"}}],"name":"Train Station Project Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","rec